WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.333
Documents waiting. Lost in someone's inbox.

00:04.333 --> 00:07.500
Meet Tawqee. Approve and sign documents without leaving SharePoint.

00:07.500 --> 00:11.000
Upload the PDF.

00:11.000 --> 00:14.666
Choose who signs, in order.

00:14.666 --> 00:20.833
Show each signer where to sign.

00:20.833 --> 00:28.333
Review the document, add your signature, and confirm.

00:28.333 --> 00:33.333
Work in English and in Arabic, right to left.

00:33.333 --> 00:38.333
Built with SharePoint and a dedicated PDF processing service.

00:38.333 --> 00:42.666
Tawqee. Document approvals and signing inside SharePoint.
